	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_LOSE_MSG_TRID_161"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくは　うえを　めざさない！
そういう　いきかたも　ありだろう？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-07T07:10:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
