				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>最高の　戦いだったぜ！
ハッ！　金なんか　くだらねぇな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-08-10T05:25:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
