				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんな　ぜいたくよりも
ぜいたくな時間を　ありがとう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-04T05:44:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
