				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみの　勝ちだ！
早く　ポケモンを　みせたまえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-08-08T06:17:24" />
