		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_LOSE_MSG_TRID_645"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けんさ　しゅうりょう！
どれ　ポケモンたちを　みせてみなさい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-04T05:45:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>検診終了！
どれ　ポケモンたちを　みせてみなさい▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-08-08T06:16:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
